    "title": "Contract for the Provision of Redcap Data Management & Statistics Analysis Support",
    "description": "This is a requirement for:\r\na. Technical support from SMEs at 0.1 FTE (4hrs per week) to include complex queries and project design, focusing on Operational Data Collection. Project design support is defined as the time dedicated to the planning, management, and implementation of the relevant RCI Redcap database, attendance at team and client meetings to discuss project support tasks and the administrative burden involved for the reporting of status of tasks and project.\r\n\r\nb. Provide Statistical analysis support at 0.1 FTE (4hrs per week) to include reviews of British Military Journal publications as and when required.",
